  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "nl": "Bodem- en zaaibedvoorbereiding",
    "en": "soil - seedbed preparation"
  },
  "definition": {
    "nl": "Het voorbereiden van bodemoppervlak en zaai- of plantzone met gekozen bewerkingen, rekening houdend met bodemstructuur en vocht.",
    "en": "Preparing the soil surface and seed zone for sowing or planting through selected mechanical operations while managing soil structure and moisture."
  },
